governors:
  fail_closed: "Unknown major, missing/stale/incompatible digest, unknown effect, or missing provenance stops the path."
  partial: "Partial coverage, omissions and fidelity are explicit; never promote them to complete evidence."
  blocked: "Unavailable dependencies, missing central artifacts and ambiguous effects remain blocked; preserve locks for reconciliation."
  cpu: YOOL agent_terms requires a CPU guardrail; the repository declaration example is 60 percent.
  disk: YOOL agent_terms requires a disk guardrail; the repository declaration example is 100 MB.
  timeout: YOOL declaration example timeout is 300 seconds; async mapper per-file default is 30.0 seconds.
  concurrency: "Async mapper file read/parse default cap is min(64, os.cpu_count() * 4); invalid positive cap inputs fall back safely."
  context_limits: "Context v1 bounds inputs at 16 MiB, depth 64, 100000 nodes, 200000 edges and 4096 source paths."
  preview_limits: Preview defaults are 200 lines and 16384 bytes; paths stay inside the mapped root.
  confidence: MEASURED requires a receipt; without one the fact is UNVERIFIED.
tests[7]{id,command,scope,purpose,status}:
  orientation-pack,python3 -m pytest tests/python/test_llm_orientation.py -q,new pack structure tests,"parse sections, required fields, source digests, commands, owners and secret rejection",focal
  python-unit,python3 -m unittest discover -s tests/python,Python package,full Python unit convention,repository gate
  node-unit,node --test tests/unit/*.test.js,Node mirror,Node unit convention,repository gate
  lint,npm run lint,JS and shell,repository lint,repository gate
  contracts-smoke,simplicio contracts smoke --json --repo .,Runtime contract smoke,contract gate,repository gate
  mapper-contract,simplicio-mapper contract validate .simplicio,Mapper JSON artifacts,schema validation,repository gate
  runtime-validate,simplicio validate "LLM orientation pack" --repo . --json,Runtime validation,deterministic repository validation,repository gate
workflow[6]{id,owner,action}:
  pin,agent,"pin repository, observed revision, branch, scope and completion oracle before action"
  survey,mapper,"run --help, runtime map, memory and relevant skills; use fresh revision and bounded evidence"
  prepare,agent,run focused tests RED before the smallest scoped change; gate and checkpoint before mutation
  mutate,dev-cli,use bounded mechanical edit/validation; Mapper only observes and emits context
  verify,runtime,"run tests, contracts and validate; persist raw evidence before verdict"
  converge,loop,coordinate retries/review and stop only on a proven completion oracle
handoff[5]{owner,input,output,rule}:
  mapper,"repository, revision, scope, task","snapshot_id, artifacts, selected_context, unresolved_questions, verification",canonical survey; no edits
  fast,fresh Mapper snapshot and compatible revision,"index_id, bounded ranked results, freshness, omissions, fallback_used",acceleration only; stale cache is untrusted
  dev-cli,"Mapper snapshot, intent, bounded plan and scope","operation_id, diff, tests, evidence_file, verdict",source mutation and validation owner
  runtime,"capability, policy, authorization, scope and preconditions","run_id, checkpoint, receipt, evidence, recomputed verdict",gates/effects/receipts; reconcile ambiguity
  loop,"task id, snapshot id, capability and bounded inputs","plan, stages, events, attempts, receipts, completion_verdict",orchestration/convergence; remains usable without Runtime
forbidden[7]: "Do not treat this cache as source truth, a universal execution schema, or permission to mutate.","Do not invent a command, option, contract owner, receipt, provider result, savings value, or missing evidence.","Do not use provider output, API keys, tokens, credentials, secret-shaped values, private source, or PII in this pack.","Do not bypass Mapper, Dev CLI, Fast, Runtime or Loop ownership boundaries.","Do not treat relevance, precedent confidence, static mapping, or a receipt word alone as proof.","Do not claim complete context when fidelity, coverage, freshness or provenance is partial.",Do not clear an unknown-effect lock or retry a mutation without Runtime reconciliation.
known_limits[12]: No .starter-meta.json was present; AGENTS.md root-mode fallback applies.,"The installed simplicio-mapper --help was observed as the command discovery surface; init, store and receipts have no listed entry.",simplicio runtime map returned partial coverage; simplicio skills deferred the Fast index because the Fast snapshot was missing.,simplicio-mapper version --json reported commit_sha null and no local wheel or sdist digests; the observed source commit is recorded separately.,python is unavailable as a command in this environment; python3 is the observed executable.,docs/architecture-map.md and docs/features/README.md retain generic template placeholders; do not infer project facts from them.,Cross-repository consumers and central worker bundles require their own fresh provenance; local generated .simplicio artifacts are disposable evidence.,"Full Python unittest collection is not green in this environment: 445 tests ran with 7 failures, 126 errors and 3 skips; missing diskcache and orjson cause import errors.","npm test is not green in this environment: the mapping-artifacts test cannot import diskcache and overlay-docs expects README.md to embed assets/overlay-install.svg.",Runtime validate is blocked by the same broad pytest collection failure; it reported 111 collection errors and exit 2.,Mapper contract validation of the generated .simplicio directory fails on the legacy architecture-inventory artifact missing producer and relationship evidence fields.,ruff is unavailable as an executable; npm lint completed with four pre-existing trailing-whitespace warnings and skipped shellcheck/PSScriptAnalyzer.
